# Sanar, Innovative First-Year: "reveal cards from the top of your library until you reveal X nonland cards" (CR 701.20): with
# fewer than X nonland cards in the library the whole library is revealed and nothing else happens. Sanar is blue and red, so X
# is 2, but on turn 3 (after the draw) Bot1's library holds only Lightning Bolt and an Island. Both are revealed; blue has no
# card to offer and is skipped without a prompt, red offers the Bolt (the Island, no color, is never offered), and Bot1 exiles
# it. The Island is shuffled back as the whole library, and the Bolt, exiled, may be cast this turn.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Ruby
Sanar, Innovative First-Year
Island x4
Island
Lightning Bolt
Island

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x24

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Red)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Sanar, Innovative First-Year.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Choose(Lightning Bolt)
? Bot1.Shuffles = 1
? Bot1.Library.Count = 1
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Exile.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot2)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass

[Expect]
Bot2.Life = 17
Bot1.Library.Count = 1
